      "jcr:created": "Fri Aug 29 2025 17:54:12 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<h4><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">The problem:&nbsp;</span></h4>\n<h3>Over 31% of ASC professionals cite rising operational costs as their top concern in 2025.<sup>1</sup> While ASCs help patients save 20–40% on out-of-pocket expenses compared to hospitals, many facilities aren’t seeing the same savings internally.<sup>2</sup></h3>\n<h4><br>\n<span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Our solution:</span></h4>\n<h3>Stryker's Sustainability Solutions (SSS) helps Ambulatory Surgical Centers lower their cost per case through high-quality reprocessed medical devices.<sup>3</sup> By partnering with SSS, facilities can achieve meaningful savings without compromising workflows.</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>We make reprocessing simple and impactful. Connect with our experts today.</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Sep 24 2025 18:06:34 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
